            "review_title": "Review at Cultra Taproom",
            "review_text": "Chris B\n7 contributions\n0\n“Eat Culturally” at Cultra Taproom\nNov 2024 • Couples\nBooked a return for our last night in Hanoi having stumbled across this gem when we first arrived. Yet again it delivered in spades, with some simply delicious and beautifully prepared and presented dishes and accompanied by some genuinely different drinks that also deliver the ‘wow’ factor! The service from the team is first class and the price is very reasonable too! Would recommend the cauliflower and beef quesadillas as must have dishes! Sorry, we didn’t get any pics - were too busy enjoying the food!!😋🤤\nRead more\nWritten November 10, 2024",
