            "review_title": "Review at Cultra Taproom",
            "review_text": "Joseph Y\n18 contributions\n0\nCombucha\nSep 2024 • Family\nThe Cultra restaurant serves delicious Vietnamese fusion cuisine. And there's delicious combo tea. I had a mango fashion fruit combo tea and it was delicious. The restaurant has three floors. The first floor is a gift shop, the second floor is a restaurant, and the third floor is a rooftop bar.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten October 28, 2024",
